   "line": 36,
   "message": "The test starts the card check `proposeRelease` and `createRelease` for the same new version `to` at the same time, then awaits them. In the reassign row, `createRelease` succeeds and commits the `to` release. If that commit lands before `proposeRelease` runs its `taken` query (release-card.ts:71), the card is refused with \"RTK already has a release t3\" on the version field instead of resolving to undefined. So the test passes or fails depending on timing. Fix: await `proposeRelease` before you call `createRelease`.",
